{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1674518400, "end_date": 1675209599, "month_true_total": 259, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:21:33 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131938597", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979339081", "personaname": "Aux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197979339081/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11710, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6683, "last_played": 1677340669, "avatar": "f9e7e02b28bf8f1f18c07a5e95cb714b795195fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great co-op", "timestamp_created": 1675169051, "timestamp_updated": 1675169051, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131926942", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053457450", "personaname": "Rodentball", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053457450/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 193, "playtime_forever": 3018, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 594, "last_played": 1744373797, "avatar": "2ffdbb29ed2128c3b03094d64fc0c938cc268a4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun if very straightforward experience. Basically, the game should’ve been made a decade ago. As an alien fan it’s a visual stunner, just under Alien Isolation in terms of how it viscerally re-creates the alien's universe. It even incorporated elements from Prometheus in ways far better than expected.  And there's some impressive deep cuts here. The only thing missing the lack of PREDATOR boss fights.  \n\nA Co-op shooter is decent; if you're nostalgic for the combat loops of GEARS OF WAR or Mass Effect 3 this will be for you. It does not have as much replay-ability of the all-time greats like L4D, DRG or Vermintide. So, I would recommend getting it on sale.   \n\nIts major issues it a that you must finish the campaign to get the other modes; which is a wildly backwards way to approach a game like this and the lack of a lobby browser. The actual progression is fine (Better than B4B some others on the market right now) but the lack of quick play from the start was a bad idea.  \n\nDecent for what it is; get it on sale.  \n\n6.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1675151346, "timestamp_updated": 1675151346, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131914585", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061381575", "personaname": "Inquiz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MrInqiuz/", "num_games_owned": 266, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 997, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 729, "last_played": 1724880736, "avatar": "5240679e656e46d5bef774bcb96d52a2a1582ebf"}, "language": "english", "review": "must have for all alien fans, if Mass Effect 3 is the gold standard for co-op shooters then this is close, better than Gears 5 co op imo", "timestamp_created": 1675130476, "timestamp_updated": 1675130476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131898000", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960416994", "personaname": "OhNoes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ohnoeshs/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 171, "playtime_forever": 852, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 712, "last_played": 1678937304, "avatar": "6393cbbd082ff9b5b4f6419a4289e016f7fab98d"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Aliens Fireteam Elite art and sound team did a really good job of making you feel like you are in the Aliens universe, but the gameplay and story is really mediocre. I enjoyed the game enough to play through the campaign once, but the gameplay is not good enough for me to replay the game and level up classes and weapons.\n\nOne thing that bothers me is sometimes the aliens get stuck on the ceiling and walls. But I understand it is difficult to design the pathing of these creatures because they change directions on multiple surfaces.", "timestamp_created": 1675119817, "timestamp_updated": 1675119817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.629637241363525391", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "131896418", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015285504", "personaname": "Tanduay Tatay", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tanduaytatay/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3163, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2665, "last_played": 1675756112, "avatar": "9b6d88ed05900a0f880735bd2ab0f28883c99c6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "horde mode is fun as f- . 10/10 just for that", "timestamp_created": 1675117520, "timestamp_updated": 1675117520, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505494534969329834", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, 